<title>MALAYSIA: Olympia shares suspended from Monday.</title>
<headline>Olympia shares suspended from Monday.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the shares of Malaysia's Olympia Industries Bhd will be suspended from Monday at the company's request, the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>It said in a statement on Saturday the request was to allow the company to make an announcement about an acquisition.</p>
<p>No further details were released either by the stock exchange or the company. They also did not say when the announcement will be made.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
